  * {@code windPhase} is a periodic animation phase in radians, used with integer noise harmonics.
+ * <p>
+ * The haze is a uniform medium independent of the field's outdoor coverage: distance haze, Nether smoke or the
+ * water the camera is in. {@code hazeExtinction} is per metre at and below {@code hazeHeight} (world height) and
+ * decays above it over {@code hazeFalloff} blocks. {@code sourceFraction} turns that share of
