+/**
+ * Fresnel cosine of a normal-mapped surface at {@code cosine} to its shading normal: never more grazing than the
+ * flat face it belongs to. A bevel turned away from the viewer would otherwise meet the view at grazing incidence
+ * and rim every block edge with Fresnel reflection.
